25 revenue of 'just over $700 million' citing people who viewed the sales deck; not recorded as revenue because it is unattributed. Expansion franchise awarded 1974; first game 1976.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://www.spokesman.com/stories/2026/sep/03/seahawks-sale-to-group-led-by-khosla-family-is-com/","name":"The Spokesman-Review (Seattle Times)","kind":"press","as_of":"2026-09-03","evidence":"The Seahawks announced Thursday afternoon that the sale has officially closed and the Khosla family is the new controlling owner of the team."},"founded_year":{"url":"https://www.spokesman.com/stories/2026/sep/03/seahawks-sale-to-group-led-by-khosla-family-is-com/","name":"The Spokesman-Review (Seattle Times)","kind":"press","as_of":"2026-09-03","evidence":"That group paid $16 million to join the league as an expansion franchise in 1974, with the Seahawks playing their first game in 1976."},"country":{"url":"https://www.seahawks.com/team/front-office-roster/","name":"Seattle Seahawks","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"Seattle Seahawks Staff, Management and Front Office"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"The Carlyle Group","status":"current","status_note":"Minority stake with Dynasty Equity (combined about 3%), closed September 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Minority stake","value_creation_plan":"Carlyle said it looks forward to supporting the Khosla family and the organization's long-term success, drawing on its experience investing in sports in Seattle.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.stocktitan.net/news/CG/carlyle-and-dynasty-equity-announce-closing-of-minority-investments-n23q7bhhsl21.html","notes":"Business Wire release (September 3, 2026): Carlyle and Dynasty Equity closed minority investments in the Seahawks in support of the Khosla family's purchase; NFL approval at the August 26 Special League Meeting. Sportico: Carlyle and Dynasty will own a combined 3%; Carlyle's first NFL investment."}},{"name":"Kinaset","website":"https://www