ents at business-aviation airports in Stuart and Fort Pierce (Florida), Manassas (Washington D.C. area), Hayward (San Francisco) and Centennial (Denver).","sector":"Industrials","subsector":"Aviation services (fixed-base operators and hangar real estate)","country":"United States","founded_year":2009,"business_model":"asset-based","leaders":[{"role":"ceo","name":"Mark Johnstone","title":"CEO","source_url":"https://appjetcenter.com/news/app-jet-center-appoints-sharyar-aziz-chief-financial-officer/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"“We are excited to welcome Sharyar as our new CFO,” said Mark Johnstone, CEO of APP Jet Center."},{"role":"cfo","name":"Sharyar Aziz","title":"Chief Financial Officer","source_url":"https://appjetcenter.com/news/app-jet-center-appoints-sharyar-aziz-chief-financial-officer/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"Stuart, Fla. – March 23, 2026 – APP Jet Center ... announced today the appointment of Sharyar Aziz as Chief Financial Officer."},{"role":"coo","name":"Eric Hietala","title":"Chief Operating Officer","source_url":"https://appjetcenter.com/news/eric-hietala-joins-app-as-chief-operating-officer/","source_kind":"company","evidence":"APP Jet Center ... announced today the appointment of Eric Hietala as Chief Operating Officer. Mr. Hietala will lead all aspects of the company’s FBO operations"}],"notes":"Owns nearly one million square feet of hangars in more than 60 buildings (company about page). Five locations: SUA, FPR, HEF, HWD and APA. Bain Capital closed the acquisition on March 10, 2026 (company news). No HQ address stated; releases datelined Stuart, Florida.","sources":{"description":{"url":"https://appjetcenter.com/news/app-jet-center-appoints-sharyar-aziz-chief-financial-officer/","name":"APP Jet Center","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-03-23","evidence":"APP Jet Center is an aviation company of fixed-based operations (FBOs) and airport real estate. It serves corporate and private air clients in strategically convenient and efficient locations within major U.S. markets"},"founded_year":{"url":"https://appjetcenter.com/about/","name":"APP Jet Center","kind":"company","as_of":null,"evidence":"APP Jet Center is an owner-managed business started in 2009, during one of the FBO industry’s deepest downturns."},"country":{"url":"https://www.baincapital.com/news/bain-capital-enters-fixed-base-operator-sector-acquisition-app-jet-center","name":"Bain Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-27","evidence":"APP Jet Center, a provider of aviation services at high-quality, supply-constrained airports in the United States"},"business_model":{"url":"https://www.baincapital.com/news/bain-capital-enters-fixed-base-operator-sector-acquisition-app-jet-center","name":"Bain Capital","kind":"sponsor","as_of":"2026-01-27","evidence":"The platform provides a full suite of aviation real estate and related services, including aircraft hangar space and fueling."}},"holding":{"sponsor":"Bain Capital","status":"current","status_note":"Majority owned since March 2026 (acquired from Ridgewood Infrastructure; announced January 27, 2026, closed March 10, 2026)","asset_class":"Real estate","deal_type":"Secondary buyout","value_creation_plan":"Bain Capital will look to actively expand APP's footprint with additional high-quality assets serving supply-constrained markets, supporting the platform's growth through continued investment in facilities, operations and leadership; management will invest across the existing network to meet growing demand for hangar storage.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.baincapital.com/news/bain-capital-enters-fixed-base-operator-sector-acquisition-app-jet-center","notes":"Bain Capital Real Estate and Special Situations deal marking its entry into the FBO sector; former Signature Aviation CEO Mark Johnstone leads the business. Company about page: 'APP Jet Center is majority owned by Bain Capital'. COO's stated ambition: grow to a 30+ location network. Terms not disclosed."}},{"name":"Mand