rch 2024, FY to March 2025)"},"email":{"url":"https://www.mandom.co.jp/en/release/pdf/2026051901_en.pdf","name":"Mandom Corporation","kind":"company","as_of":"2026-05-19","evidence":"Contact mail: press@mandom.com (Please contact us in Japanese or English.)"}},"holding":{"sponsor":"CVC Capital Partners","status":"current","status_note":"Taken private via a CVC-backed MBO with the Nishimura founding family: tender offer by Kalon Holdings completed February 2026; delisted from TSE May 15, 2026","asset_class":"Private equity","deal_type":"Take-private","value_creation_plan":"CVC said it will support (i) further expansion and improvement of Mandom's existing businesses, including revitalising its main brands and restructuring the Indonesian business, (ii) fundamental improvement of the management system and organization, (iii) discontinuous growth through M&A and alliances, and (iv) business development and value chain reinforcement in the global market.","value_creation_source_url":"https://www.mandom.co.jp/en/release/pdf/2025092502_en.pdf","notes":"Tender offeror Kalon Holdings Co., Ltd., owned via Kalon J Group Holdings and Hong Kong holding companies by CVC Capital Partners Asia VI (A) L.P. (88.1%), CVC Capital Partners Asia VI (B) SCSp (9.0%) and CVC Capital Partners Investment Asia VI L.P. (2.0%). 32,359,329 shares tendered (results notice dated February 26, 2026). CVC Asia Pacific (Japan) partners and advisers joined the board on May 19, 2026."}},{"name":"Stark","website":"https://stark-defence.com/en","description":"European defence-tech company specialised in unmanned weapons systems across multiple domains (loitering munitions, unmanned surface vessels and C2 software): AI-enabled, software-defined and ready for affordable production at scale.","sector":"Industrial","subsector":"Defence technology (unmanned weapons systems, loitering munitions)","country":"Germany","founded_year":2024,"business_model":"B2G","email":"contact@stark-defence.com","email_type":"gen